      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "A report on a whole mods folder no longer fails with `table overflow`: it is written a file at a time.",
        "fixed": [
          "`check`, `info` and `fix` write their report to standard output a file at a time, as the same text, so a run over tens of thousands of NIFs never builds its whole document as one string. Needs jess 0.2.2 or later, whose YAML and JSON writers no longer overflow a table on a document of millions of lines."
        ]
      },
